@left


![Instructor figure related to protein domains and dna shuffling](assets/lect04c-talking_points_set_3/image_083.jpg)


@right

- Protein modules carry distinct functions
- Promoter module first; terminator module last
- Overlapping primers assemble ordered or random combinations
- Screen libraries for new functions
